638
00:11:29.541 --> 00:11:30.333
Dichas revisiones

639
00:11:30.333 --> 00:11:31.166
deben presentarse

640
00:11:31.166 --> 00:11:31.625
para revisión pública

641
00:11:31.625 --> 00:11:32.500
y provincial

642
00:11:32.541 --> 00:11:33.166
en un plazo de dos

643
00:11:33.166 --> 00:11:34.041
ciclos lunares.

644
00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.000
Huele a victoria,

645
00:11:36.208 --> 00:11:37.250
y apenas un toque

646
00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.750
de metano de pan de jengibre.

647
00:11:38.833 --> 00:11:39.833
Y decían que la magia

648
00:11:39.833 --> 00:11:40.583
no se puede medir

649
00:11:40.583 --> 00:11:42.083
en partes por millón.

650
00:11:42.208 --> 00:11:43.458
Se levanta la sesión.

651
00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:44.250
Que sus calderas

652
00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:45.083
ardan con fuerza, y que su

653
00:11:45.083 --> 00:11:45.791
circuito navideño

654
00:11:45.791 --> 00:11:46.458
siga alegre.

655
00:11:48.291 --> 00:11:49.166
¿Está de acuerdo

656
00:11:49.166 --> 00:11:51.125
con el veredicto de Judge GPT?

657
00:11:51.875 --> 00:11:52.708
Ejercite

658
00:11:52.708 --> 00:11:54.208
su deber cívico.

659
00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.791
Únase al jurado virtual

660
00:11:56.041 --> 00:11:56.541
y pulse

661
00:11:56.541 --> 00:11:57.791
el botón «Me gusta».

662
00:11:57.833 --> 00:11:58.833
O deje un comentario

663
00:11:58.833 --> 00:11:59.416
diciendo

664
00:11:59.458 --> 00:12:00.208
cómo USTED

665
00:12:00.208 --> 00:12:01.083
habría fallado

666
00:12:01.083 --> 00:12:02.416
